<h2>Highly Integration</h2>
<p>The Matrix AIO P1 HD FC combines the STM32G473 flight controller, Blueja=
y ESC, Serial ELRS 2.4G receiver, and P1 Air Unit VTX into a single, compac=
t board =E2=80=93 minimizing wiring and simplifying builds. The STM32G473 M=
CU runs at 168MHz, delivering excellent computing capacity for responsive f=
light performance. The powerful ESC features a robust 12A continuous curren=
t (18A peak) to meet the high surge demands of 1S digital whoops. Paired wi=
th the P1 Air Unit HD VTX, enjoy a 1080p@60fps live feed with approximately=
 60ms latency =E2=80=93 crisp, immersive digital video at an affordable cos=
t.</p>
<h2>Know More About ArtLynk Protocol</h2>
<p>The ArtLynk protocol is a low-latency, long-range communication protocol=
 for drones, offering superior stability and range over traditional analog =
VTX. ArtLynk protocol enables real-time HD video at about 60ms latency from=
 glass to glass, which is crucial for smooth flight control and high-qualit=
y FPV (First Person View). Here are the key features you may want to know.<=
/p>
<ul>
<li><span><strong>Artosyn Inside &amp; KAP Supported:&nbsp;</strong>ArtLynk=
 protocol uses the Artosyn's latest AR803X chipset, with core technology su=
pport provided by KAP (KAP company provides core technology support or prod=
uct solution to all FPV companies and ensures compatibility for various FPV=
 products using Artosyn chipsets).</span></li>
<li>
<span><strong>Collaborative and Open Community:&nbsp;</strong></span>ArtLyn=
k protocol is a collaborative FPV ecosystem not belonging to ONLY one compa=
ny. Many FPV enterprises and teams would design and produce their own produ=
cts based on the ArtLynk protocol, ensuring broad compatibility and fosteri=
ng community.</li>
</ul>
<p>The ArtLynk protocol supports the following devices, letting you customi=
ze your own build or simply bind and fly:</p>
<ul>
<li>BETAFPV <a href=3D"https://betafpv.com/products/p1-air-unit-hd-vtx">P1 =
Air Unit</a>, <a href=3D"https://betafpv.com/products/vr04-hd-fpv-goggles">=
VR04 HD Goggles</a>, <a href=3D"https://betafpv.com/products/aquila20-brush=
less-whoop-quadcopter">Aquila20 P1</a>, <a href=3D"https://betafpv.com/prod=
ucts/meteor75-pro-p1-brushless-whoop-quadcopter">Meteor75 Pro P1</a>, <a hr=
ef=3D"https://betafpv.com/products/monitor">Monitor</a>, <a href=3D"https:/=
/betafpv.com/products/p1-hd-vrx-standard">P1 HD VRX (Standard)</a>, <a href=
=3D"https://betafpv.com/products/p1-hd-vrx-nano">P1 HD VRX (Nano) [Beta Tes=
t]</a>, <a href=3D"https://betafpv.com/products/matrix-1s-brushless-flight-=
controller-aio-p1-hd-vtx">Matrix 1S AIO P1 HD FC [Beta Test]</a><br>
</li>
<li><a href=3D"https://www.hglrc.com/products/hglrc-draco-a1-a2-hd-vtx" rel=
=3D"noopener" target=3D"_blank">HGLRC Draco</a></li>
